ontinuously improving your approach as this evolving practice develops. </span></div><img src="https://library.exchange.aboutamazon.com/locale/en-us/resource-type/image/variation/desktop/carboninsets-secondaryhero-1.jpg" alt="Airplanes" class="srbjgTS+TGDkakr3my7h+Q== yQmU4EAkGkExnsISv339RA==" style="object-position: center center;"></div><div class="yQmU4EAkGkExnsISv339RA== rNGHPSQ6LkJ5dUp7gTbPUA==" slot="footer"><a class="cBBp0ONkDstSWuqP2JmSvA== yQmU4EAkGkExnsISv339RA==" href="/focus-areas/carbon-insets">Explore resources<span class="nGhq-x-dJ+-45UR7uHLG+Q==">about Carbon insets</span></a><button type="button" class="Js4GC7cB0-subip38bKr5g== yQmU4EAkGkExnsISv339RA== n9BnU8njKKPitn8lxE9YkA== _7CXANYxqW7qd2wdisHratw== tOV-FDSAFbMqKyrVCUChoQ== wtnjwFrHnrUqF-MpDbUWPg==" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><div class="xqSJF7EizIbffxS4477n+A=="><div class="toY9qAd1V+rWGvDrNX-khw=="><div data-testid="chevronRight" class="yy0troY67pTtaADpsTh59A== j89QodfcxgjOuaGVSCZF4A== C1aPjd9XufeYH2TKSqdDgg=="><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" aria-hidden="false"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M13.516 11.234 9.359 7.771l1.28-1.537 4.157 3.464a3 3 0 0 1 0 4.61L10.64 17.77l-1.28-1.537 4.156-3.463a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.537" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="aOavLwtG+YSFNpB2Mz7hIw=="><div data-testid="chevronRight" class="yy0troY67pTtaADpsTh59A== j89QodfcxgjOuaGVSCZF4A== C1aPjd9XufeYH2TKSqdDgg=="><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" aria-hidden="false"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M13.516 11.234 9.359 7.771l1.28-1.537 4.157 3.464a3 3 0 0 1 0 4.61L10.64 17.77l-1.28-1.537 4.156-3.463a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.537" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div></div></div></button></div></kat-card><kat-card class="yQmU4EAkGkExnsISv339RA== Kl0R4BmG8oZ4BeQGC5QOFg=="><div class="yQmU4EAkGkExnsISv339RA== -MM906qstVtBMmRXHmIoxA=="><div class="NU2KPx33ngUpx1lzW29uTQ=="><